    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338148
    m_Localized: "Geli\u015Ftirici: Ramin Rasulzade"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338149
    m_Localized: "Unity 6000.6 (URP) \u2022 Apple Metal \u2022 WebGPU"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338150
    m_Localized: NASIL OYNANIR?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338151
    m_Localized: 1. KONTROLLER VE FIRLATMA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338152
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Raketi y\xF6nlendirmek i\xE7in parma\u011F\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 veya fareyi sa\u011Fa sola kayd\u0131r\u0131n.\n\u2022 Klavye: A/D veya Sol/Sa\u011F y\xF6n tu\u015Flar\u0131.\n\u2022 Topu f\u0131rlatmak i\xE7in ekrana dokunun, t\u0131klay\u0131n veya Bo\u015Fluk tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338153
    m_Localized: "2. D\u0130NAM\u0130K A\xC7ILI SEKME"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338154
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Topun sekme a\xE7\u0131s\u0131 rakete \xE7arpt\u0131\u011F\u0131 noktaya g\xF6re de\u011Fi\u015Fir! Tam ortas\u0131 dik (90\xB0), k\xF6\u015Feler ise keskin ni\u015Fan i\xE7in yatay a\xE7\u0131lar (30\xB0) verir."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338155
    m_Localized: 3. PUANLAMA VE ZIRHLI BLOKLAR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338156
    m_Localized: "\u2022 K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 = 10 Puan \u2022 Ye\u015Fil = 20 Puan \u2022 Mavi = 30 Puan.\n\u2022 Cam Bloklar 2 vuru\u015Fta k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r: \u0130lk vuru\u015F cam z\u0131rh\u0131 par\xE7alar, ikinci vuru\u015F blo\u011Fu k\u0131rarak 2X puan kazand\u0131r\u0131r!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338157
    m_Localized: "4. G\xDC\xC7LEND\u0130RMELER VE TUZAKLAR"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1013338158
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Geni\u015Fletici: Raketi +%10 b\xFCy\xFCt\xFCr.\n\u2022 Skor \xC7arpanlar\u0131: Blok ba\u015F\u0131na 2X, 3X, 4X, 5X ekstra puan.\n\u2022 Enerji Kalkan\u0131: Alt b\xF6lgeyi 10 saniye boyunca korur.\n\u2022 \xC7oklu Top: Sahaya 3 top s\xFCrer! Ekstra toplar can g\xF6t\xFCrmez.\n\u2022 Lazer Topu: \xC7ift namlulu lazerlerle bloklar\u0131 tarar!\n\u2022 Bomba Blok: \xC7evresindeki bloklar\u0131 zincirleme patlat\u0131r!\n\u2022 Ekstra Can: +1 can verir (maksimum 5).\n\u2022 Son Blok Sayac\u0131: Sadece 1 blok kald\u0131\u011F\u0131nda 12 saniyelik geri say\u0131m ba\u015Flar; hemen k\u0131r\u0131p 10X'e kadar bonus kap\u0131n ya da Hiper Lazer blo\u011Fu yok etsin!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12263776839946240
    m_Localized: REKOR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
